Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.40,1:32:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,《驯龙高手2》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是博克岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Berk,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.94,0:01:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是... 世界上最大的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the best kept secret this side of, well... anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管看上去不怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted, it may not look like much,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但由此湿润山石堆砌而成的博克岛绝对让你叹为观止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this wet heap of rock packs more than a few surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的生活超级棒 但是不太适合胆小的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life here is amazing, just not for the faint of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道其他地方的人都喜欢木工和针线活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, where most folks enjoy hobbies like whittling or needlepoint,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们博克人更喜欢...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we Berkians prefer...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,做点小运动 我们称之为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little something we like to call...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,赛龙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragon racing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哇吼吼! 吼吼! 不好意思啊 鱼脚司 你想要这个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa-ho-ho! Ho-ho! I'm sorry, Fishlegs, did you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.35,0:02:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 鼻涕虫 那是我的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Snotlout, that was mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,给你 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我有没有说过你今天很美? 因为你真的很美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I tell you that you look amazing today? 'Cause you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,呃! 快点走 吐吐 有臭气过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh! Come on, Barf. It's starting to stink around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我还是很恨你 我们来扫平这片地吧 喷喷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope, still hates you. Let's blow this place, Belch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.58,0:02:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 哈哈! 那是双胞胎的第九只了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, ha-ha! That's nine for the twins!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,阿丝翠德只有三只!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Astrid lags with three!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼脚司和鼻涕虫一只都没有!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fishlegs and Snotlout trail with none!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,而小嗝嗝...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Hiccup is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不见人影 唔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nowhere to be found. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不是你说那么大的事儿把他吓跑的吗 斯多戈?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scared him off with the big talk, didn't you, Stoick?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛 鼻涕虫? 他们就要赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing, Snotlout? They're gonna win now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的公主... 她想要什么我都给她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's my princess... whatever she wants, she gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:03:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,拉芙纳特? 她之前不是要把你活埋了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruffnut? Didn't she try to bury you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一会儿啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,龙曾经在这里是个麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, dragons used to be a bit of a problem here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但那已经是五年前的事了 现在都已经融入了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that was five years ago. Now they've all moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而且说实话 为什么不呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, really, why wouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有定做的龙棚 什么都能吃到的食槽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have custom stables, all-you-can-eat feeding stations,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,洗浴桑拿一条龙服务...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a full-service dragon wash...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至还有用绳子吊着的防火设施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even top-of-the-line fire prevention, if I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 时间到了 高博 - 准备好了 最后一圈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah, it's time, Gobber. - Righty-ho. Last lap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,黑羊! 快 暴飞飞! 我们还能靠这个赢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The black sheep! Come on, Stormfly! We can still win this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 吐吐! - 我们上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Barf! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快 肉丸儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Meatlug!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是你的重要时刻 飞行愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your big moment. Have a nice flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,上! 上 上 上 上 上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up! Up, up, up, up, up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 肉丸儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good job, Meatlug!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,给你 亲爱的 这个顶十只羊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, darling. Mine's worth ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,耶! 黑羊到手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! The black sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是在争拉芙纳特吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are fighting for Ruffnut?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我赢定了! - 我们一起赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm totally winning! - We're winning together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,喔! 没人能阻止我啦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo! No one can stop me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,除了我 我们可是连在一起的 小天才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for me. We're attached, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 少来抢我的荣誉! - 嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Quit trying to steal all my glory! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,抢他们的 阿丝翠德!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them, Astrid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是我的荣誉! - 你老是弄砸一切!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's my glory! - Always ruining everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 无羊不荣耀! - 拿到啦! 哈哈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, sheep, no glory! - Gotcha! Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇哦! - 阿丝翠德!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa! - Astrid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well played!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.91,0:04:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是我未来儿媳妇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my future daughter-in-law!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,喔吼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.11,0:04:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 不好意思了 - 暴飞飞!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh, excuse me. - Stormfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,十三只! 阿丝翠德赢了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's 13! Astrid takes the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 博克岛是个非常棒的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep, Berk is pretty much perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.11,0:05:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我的所有努力都有了回报 这是件好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of my hard work has paid off. And it's a good thing, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.94,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们维京人骑在龙背上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because with Vikings on the backs of dragons...
