Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样 伙计? 想要再来一次吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, bud? You want to give this another shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔! 不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless! It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,耶...!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...!
