Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这可太棒了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不怎么棒 没牙仔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No longer amazing. Toothless!
