Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是突发事件啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That really came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.41,0:08:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真得处理一下你的单边尾翼了 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We-we got to work on your solo gliding there, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 呃 是因为尾巴被锁了所以营救不够及时 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That, uh, locked-up tail makes for some pretty sloppy rescue maneuvers, hey?
