Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.68,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你又撅嘴撒娇啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why you're pouting, big baby boo?
