Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:09:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,呃... 你 你说得对 你说得对 你赢了 你赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... Y-you're right, you're right. You win. You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他被打倒了! 输得真惨啊! 龙和维京勇士...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's down! And it's ugly! Dragons and Vikings...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,又变成敌人了 苦战缠身...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}enemies again. Locked in combat to the bitter...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哦...!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这洗不掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that doesn't wash out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们给这地方起什么名字?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what should we name it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那就"痒痒的胳肢窝"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Itchy armpit" it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你在想什么 伙计? 在想我们可能在这里发现几个伐木工?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you reckon, bud? Think we might find a few Timberjacks in those woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:10:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说石头里有低语的死神?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The odd whispering death or two in the rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢 也许我们能找到另一个夜煞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows, maybe we'll finally track down another Night Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那也挺棒的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't that be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你有什么想法? 继续这样下去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you say? Just keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,下午好 女士 你去哪儿了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afternoon, milady. Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 去赢比赛呗 还能有什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, winning races. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真正该问的是 你去哪儿了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real question is, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 躲我老爸 - 哦 不 这次是什么事儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Avoiding my dad. - Oh, no. What happened now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你会... 你会喜欢这事儿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're gonna... You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,今天早上我起床 阳光明媚 恐怖龙在屋顶歌唱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wake up, the sun's shining, terrible terrors are singing on the rooftop,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我悠闲地去吃早餐 想着这世界多美妙 然后他跟我说:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saunter down to breakfast thinking all is right with the world, and I get:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"儿子 我们得谈一谈"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Son, we need to talk."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"现在别 老爸 我还得开始今天的游手好闲呢"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Not, now, Dad. I got a whole day of goofing off to get started."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:11:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 首先 我的声音不是那样的 你模仿的那是谁啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, first of all, I don't sound like that. What is this character?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还有... 还有其次...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And... and second...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你学我时那么抖肩膀是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that thing you're doing with my shoulders?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那还真是个讨喜的模仿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's a really flattering impersonation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.23,0:11:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他接着说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, he goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"你是博克岛的骄傲 儿子 我也感觉无比自豪"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're the pride of Berk, son, and I couldn't be prouder."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 谢谢 老爸 我也觉得自己很厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, thanks, Dad. I'm pretty impressed with myself, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手什么时候那样比划过?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When have I ever done that with my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你刚刚就是! - 好吧 现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You just did! - Okay, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,待着... 别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold... still.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很严肃的 - 嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very serious. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"你已经长大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're all grown up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,因为首领找不到更好的继承人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and since no chief could ask for a better successor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我决定..." - 让你当首领!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've decided..." - To make you chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊! 小嗝嗝 这太棒了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my gods! Hiccup, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哦...!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你会打坏弹簧圈的 校准很麻烦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna wear out the spring coil. The calibration is very sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这事儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is what I'm dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.48,0:11:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么跟他说的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 什么都没说 他转身的瞬间我就跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I didn't. By the time he turned around, I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哈 好吧... 这是个很重的担子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh. Well... it's a lot of responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,地图要先放放了 这是肯定的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The map will have to wait, for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,而且... 我得去遛没牙仔 因为你会很忙 但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and... and I'll need to fly Toothless, since you'll be too busy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我 阿丝翠德 所有的演讲 计划 还有管理整个村子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not me, Astrid. All those speeches and planning and running the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是他的事 - 我觉得你忘了重点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- that's his thing. - I think you're missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说... 首领啊 多么荣耀的事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean... chief. What an honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是我的话 我会超级激动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be pretty excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 我不是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你... 你清楚地知道你是谁 你一直都知道 但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You... know exactly who you are, you always have, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我还在寻找 我知道我不是我父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still looking. I know that I'm not my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我也从没见过我妈妈 所以... 我到底是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I never met my mother, so... What does that make me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你寻找的东西并不在外面 小嗝嗝...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're searching for isn't out there, Hiccup...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.57,0:12:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,它在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你只是还没发现而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you just don't see it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 啊! - 也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ugh. Ugh! - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 你知道的... 外面的确有些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you know... there is something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiccup...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这里发生了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 放松 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, e-easy, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开火! - 阿丝翠德 小心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fire! - Astrid, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,小心尾巴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch the tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,把腿绑住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tie those legs up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有眼花吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 住手! - 暴飞飞!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop! - Stormfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在做什么?!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,又回来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,吓尿了 那可是只夜煞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soil my britches. That is a Night Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为它们永远的消失了呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought they were all gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们时来运转了 伙计们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like our luck's had a turn for the better, lads!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想德雷格的龙族战队里... 可没有这么一只龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think Drago has one of those... in his dragon army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:14:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,龙族战队?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragon army?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们不想惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哈! 这种事你应该在偷了我们所有的龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hah! You should have thought of that before you stole all of our dragons
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还把我们的碉堡炸成碎片之前就想好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and blasted our fort to bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.87,0:15:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 你在说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得是我们干的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think we did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈! 没有好的驯龙骑士从中协助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hah! Dragon trapping is hard enough work as it is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,捕龙者的工作已经很艰辛了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without do-gooder Dragon Riders sneaking in to rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么好的...? 还有其他的驯龙骑士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do-gooder...? There are other Dragon Riders?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.31,0:15:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说除了你昨晚的小偷朋友以外吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean other than your thieving friend from last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我 你也许有一只会喷冰的龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell me. You may have an ice-spitting dragon on your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们这边还差一只{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we still have a quota to fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我们怎么跟德雷格·布拉维斯特交代?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you suppose we explain this mess to Drago Bludvist?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,德雷格什么玩意? 你知道你自己在说什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drago what-fist? Does anything you say make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他还等着在明天之前拿到一批新龙呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's expecting a new shipment of dragons for his army by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而且德雷格不听任何借口!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Drago don't take well to excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是上次我空手去见他他给我留下的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what he gave me last time I showed up empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在未来他只会变得更不近人情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He promised to be far less understanding in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 我根本不知道什么窃龙贼的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, look, we don't know anything about a dragon thief
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也不知道什么喷冰的龙 还有你那个疯子老板和他的龙族战队的事 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or an ice-spitting dragon or your lunatic boss and his dragon army, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们的龙还回来 我们马上走...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give us back our dragon, and we'll go...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不认识你这个不怀好意的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange, hostile person whom we've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我怎么这么没礼貌?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, where are my manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我是艾瑞特... 艾瑞特的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Eret... Son of Eret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,最出色的捕龙者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finest dragon trapper alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟... 不是谁都能抓到一只夜煞的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all... It's not just anyone who can capture a Night Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是没牙仔 他说我们要走了 马上就走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is Toothless. He says we're going. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哈! 他们都说过这话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hah! They all say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他们 兄弟们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rush 'em, lads!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,暴飞飞 过来! 快! 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stormfly, come on! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远不可能拥有那条龙! 听到没?!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never hold on to those dragons! You hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,德雷格要把它们全拿下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drago is coming for them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 肉丸儿! - 喔吼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Meatlug! - Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 斯多戈! - 嘿 你好吗? 美丽的一天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey there, Stoick! - Hey, how are you? Beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 斯巴洛特 比赛很棒 - 耶...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello, Spitelout. Great race. - Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哦! 抱歉 阿柯夫人 有他的消息吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Sorry, Mrs. Ack. Any sign of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,诶! 他现在可能已经飞到世界边缘去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eh! He's probably flown off the edge of the world by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.34,0:17:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定你要让那孩子来管理村子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you want that kid running the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.31,0:17:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你可以推迟退休 - 哦 他已经准备好了 你会明白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can still delay your retirement. - Oh, he's ready. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿! 哈? 博克岛的骄傲!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is! Huh? The pride of Berk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,最后还是决定来工作的家伙 耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who finally decided to show up for work. Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.85,0:17:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 路上遇到点事情 嘿 老爸 我能跟你谈谈吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, got held up. Hey, uh, Dad, could I have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有事想迫不及待地告诉我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something you're itching to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 不是你想的那个迫不及待 不过 也算是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, not quite the itch you're thinking of, but, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好孩子! 现在 第一课:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good man! Now, lesson one:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.15,0:17:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一个首领最重要的职责就是他的人民 那么... 四十一号!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chief's first duty is to his people, so... 41!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们能不能私下里谈谈...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, can we just talk in private for...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四十... - 是我! 是我! 下一个是我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Forty... - That's me! That's me! I'm next!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 我在你前面! - 如果我们能谈谈...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, I was ahead of you! - If we could just talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我已经在这里等了一天了 好了 好了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. I've been here all day. Okay, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要一个有很多钉子的高座位...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want one of those high seaters with lots of spikes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.23,0:18:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有一个大的器材箱! - 当然可以! 马上给你 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and a big storage compartment! - Absolutely! You got it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 这事儿真的比装龙鞍要重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, this is actually a little more important than building saddles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 第二课: 为人民服务没有小事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, lesson two: No task is too small when it comes to serving your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是 老爸... - 哦 不好意思 喷火龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But, Dad... - Oh, excuse us, grump.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们能不能就谈... - 呀! 喷火龙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can we just talk... - Yah! Grump!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你又让熔炉的火灭了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let the forge die down again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.87,0:18:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样的 喷火龙! 得把你送人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, grump! You're going up for adoption.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.91,0:18:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 呃... - 给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, uh... - There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸... - 去吧 拿过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad... - Go on. Have away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 但是说真的 我真得和你谈谈我们发现的另一个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but seriously, I really need to tell you about this new land we came across.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 另一个? - 有新的龙吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Another one? - Any new dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没去找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't stick around to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人真的不太友善{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These folks weren't particularly friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗? 你的夜煞和致命纳德没把他们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really? Your Night Fury and Deadly Nadder didn't bring them...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.72,0:18:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 震慑得为你欢呼? - 不 这次不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- cheering to the rooftops? - No, this was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是那种一般的小强盗土匪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the standard run-for-the-hills hoo-ha I've come to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:19:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是捕猎的 捕龙者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys were trappers. Dragon trappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们应该见过他们的堡垒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have seen their fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,被炸成了碎片冻在巨大的冰刺里面 真的非常诡异{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All blown apart and stuck in giant spikes of ice. It was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.28,0:19:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过那样的事 最糟的是 他们以为是我们干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen anything like it. And worst of all, they thought we did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你要知道 你们两个这样子迟早会惹来大祸的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you two are gonna get yourselves in serious trouble one of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不是每个人都喜欢这样的生活的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everyone appreciates this way of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,赞成 高博说得对 儿子 我们最好管好自己的事儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Gobber's right, son. Best we keep to our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,除此之外 你要把时间花在更重要的事情上 知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, you'll have more important uses for your time. Huh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,到时我们要弄个特大公告!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we make the big announcement!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在造龙族战队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are building a dragon army.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,或者至少是在为此准备 呃...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or at least the guy they work for is. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"德雷格... 什么玩意" 还是什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dargo... bloody fist" or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他要是敢抢我的龙 我让他吃不了兜着走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bloody his fist with my face if he tries to take my dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.81,0:19:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! 你真是个二货 - 一个美丽的二货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ugh! You're such a moron. - A beautiful moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.85,0:19:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.39,0:19:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,布拉维斯特? 德雷格·布拉维斯特?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bludvist? Drago Bludvist?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.56,0:19:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 是的 等等... 你知道他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah. Wait... you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.73,0:20:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让所有的龙都着陆! - 什么? 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ground all dragons! - What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,关严大门! 把外门降下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the gates! Lower the storm doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 喔 喔 等等 等等 发生了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa, wait, wait. What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.71,0:20:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快点! 听到了吧 快关门!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! You heard the man, lock it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我下令 否则所有的龙和维京人都不能踏出这个岛半步!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No dragon or Viking sets foot off this island until I give the word!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.85,0:20:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 就因为某个你认识的人在很远的地方惹麻烦吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, because some guy you knew is stirring up trouble in some faraway land?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因为德雷格·布拉维斯特是个疯子 他心狠手辣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Drago Bludvist is a madman without conscience or mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.45,0:20:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他真的在组建龙族战队 我们一定得全力准备迎战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he's built a dragon army, gods help us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把它们关回笼子里! - 是 斯多戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get them into their pens! - Aye, Stoick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点! - 那我们就飞回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Quickly! - Then let's ride back out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着那些抓龙的人找到德雷格 给他讲讲道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll follow those trappers to Drago and talk some sense into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们要加固防御{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We fortify the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 维护和平是我们的责任 - 没有和平了 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's our duty to keep the peace. - Peace is over, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.21,0:20:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要做好迎战的准备 - 迎战?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I must prepare you for war. - War?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.91,0:20:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 要是德雷格来抢我们的龙 我们不能坐以待毙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, if Drago's coming for our dragons, we can't wait around for him to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.05,0:20:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去找他 劝他改变想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go find him and change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 有些人的想法是不会改变的 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, some minds won't be changed, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:21:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,博克岛才是你应该担心的 首领要保护好自己的家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Berk is what you need to worry about. A chief protects his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.93,0:21:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,保护好龙厩 锁好围栏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secure the stables! Latch every stall!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小嗝嗝 别去 - 我一定要去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hiccup, don't. - I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这边! 快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.07,0:21:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,加油!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,睁大眼睛 伙计们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your eyes peeled, lads!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,顺着这阵风 明天天亮我们就能见到德雷格了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With this wind, we'll reach Drago by daybreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最好尽快抓几只龙放在船上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So best we fill this ship up with dragons, and quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没时间挑挑拣拣的了! - 呃 艾瑞特?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's no time to be picky! - Uh, Eret?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要是想活命...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if we want to keep our...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在左舷船尾!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heads! Off the port quarter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.77,0:21:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,网住他们! 打下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Net them, lads! Take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.97,0:21:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有两只! 就在左边!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's two of them! Up on the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这次跑不了了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not getting away this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.81,0:21:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:21:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,重装!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reload!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 重装! 来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, reload! Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.19,0:22:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才我还担心我们可能会空手而归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here I was, worried we might turn up empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不会了 今天你走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. It's your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.29,0:22:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们投降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一只夜煞 还有一只致命纳得 还有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one Night Fury, uh, one Deadly Nadder, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.80,0:22:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,西边岛上的两位驯龙高手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two of the finest Dragon Riders west of Luk Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这下你们老板该满意了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ought to make the boss happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,让一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这是干什么? - 没牙仔 别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Toothless, stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.81,0:22:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 龙不太喜欢拥挤的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, the dragons don't really care for cramped spaces,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以它们就和你们待着吧 它们很乖的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they'll just hang out with you. They won't be any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.32,0:22:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你先挑事 你也懂的 航行在大海里的木船...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you do that. You know, wooden boats, big ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.89,0:22:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你... 你们的泳技如何? - 不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- H... how is your swimming? - Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.53,0:22:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 差点忘了 囚犯不能带武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops. Almost forget. Can't have armed prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.30,0:22:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么计划?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is this a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.03,0:22:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为捕龙者准备的工具而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what every dragon trapper needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.97,0:22:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一端是涂着猛烈凶魇唾液的刀刃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One end coats the blade in Monstrous Nightmare saliva.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.31,0:23:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,另一边能喷射丑陋双头龙的瓦斯气体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other sprays hideous zippleback gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.08,0:23:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要一点火花 然后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All it takes is a spark, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.31,0:23:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒 干得漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.95,0:23:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他们开始把你当做自己人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once they see you as one of their own,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,再暴躁的龙都是可以驯服的 对吧 兄弟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even the testiest dragons can be trained. Right, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个给我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你这玩的是哪一出?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What game are you playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.66,0:23:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我可没在玩 我们只是想见见德雷格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, no game. We just want to meet Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.33,0:23:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我要改变他对龙的看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm going to change his mind about dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.17,0:23:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他很善于说服别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can be really persuasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只要它决定对你忠心 就可以为你赴汤蹈火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you've earned his loyalty, there is nothing a dragon won't do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.91,0:23:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你无法改变这里任何人的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't be changing any minds around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在马上就能说服你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can change yours, right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.25,0:23:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, may I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.99,0:23:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当心! - 龙骑士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch it! - Dragon Riders!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:23:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.73,0:24:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鼻涕虫 你... 你要干什么? - 看我对你多好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Snotlout, what... what are you doing? - See how well I protect and provide?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.94,0:24:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这些网是干什么的? - 嘿 小心! 真是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is with all the nets? - Hey, watch it! That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.01,0:24:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.15,0:24:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真是我的菜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me likey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.79,0:24:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,带我走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,住手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.27,0:24:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 你们来这里干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, what are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们来救你! - 我用不着你们救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're here to rescue you! - I don't need to be rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.14,0:24:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,够了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.71,0:24:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 你们是不是上错船了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, didn't you just pick the wrong ship, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.38,0:24:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我是艾瑞特 和我爸爸... 一个名字...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Eret, Son of... Eret...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.65,0:24:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.16,0:24:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get this thing off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.36,0:25:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁? 嗯 我猜到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone else? Hmm, that's what I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.90,0:25:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你 准备好 我们回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, saddle up. We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.00,0:25:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.83,0:25:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样一点责任心都没有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all the irresponsible...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.84,0:25:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要保护我们的家园 阻止战争的发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to protect our dragons and stop a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.01,0:25:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这怎么就是没有责任心了? - 因为他就想要战争!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is that irresponsible? - Because war is what he wants, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.95,0:25:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,许多年前 来自各地的首领聚集一堂...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years ago, there was a great gathering of chieftains...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.72,0:25:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,共同讨论如何应对大家共同的敌人 也就是龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to discuss the dragon we all faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.45,0:25:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之中 走出一位来自遥远地方的陌生人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into our midst came a stranger from a strange land,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.99,0:25:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他浑身伤疤 披着龙皮斗篷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}covered in scars and draped in a cloak of dragon skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.83,0:25:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有武器 说话的语气也很柔和{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He carried no weapon and spoke softly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.43,0:25:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他叫德雷格·布拉维斯特 并非首领{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saying that he, Drago Bludvist, was a man of the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.91,0:25:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一生致力于从龙的暴虐中解救人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}devoted to freeing mankind from the tyranny of dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.48,0:25:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他说只有他可以掌控所有的龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He claimed that he alone could control the dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.85,0:25:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,保护大家的安全 只要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that he alone could keep us safe, if...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.75,0:25:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们臣服于他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we chose to bow down and follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.46,0:26:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蠢货 - 笑死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stupid. - Ah, good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.23,0:26:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我们也笑了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, we laughed, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.63,0:26:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他裹紧斗篷 喊着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until he wrapped himself in his cloak and cried out,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.66,0:26:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- "那就看看 没有我你们能怎么办!" - 那就看看 没有我你们能怎么办!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "then see how well you do without me!" - See how well you do without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.57,0:26:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,房顶瞬间被点燃 身披战甲的龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rooftop suddenly burst into flames, and from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.51,0:26:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,从天而降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}armored dragons descended,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大火烧塌了整个房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}burning the hall to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.84,0:26:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.18,0:26:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是唯一的幸存者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was the only one to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.45,0:26:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不问原因只管杀人的人 是没法跟他讲道理的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men who kill without reason cannot be reasoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.39,0:26:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许吧 - 小嗝嗝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe. - Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可我还是要试试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still going to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.33,0:26:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我擅长的事情 而且... 而且如果我能够说服你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what I'm good at, and... and if I could change your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.60,0:26:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我也可以说服他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can change his, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.10,0:26:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.54,0:26:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 不行! 带其他人回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - No! Lead the others back to Berk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.82,0:26:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的麻烦够大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had enough mutiny for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.55,0:27:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我好喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.32,0:27:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拉芙纳特!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruffnut!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.09,0:27:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.01,0:27:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 伙计 我绝不会让你受到任何伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, bud. I'm not gonna let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.01,0:27:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.39,0:27:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗷 老爸 你至不至于?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, come on, Dad. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.87,0:27:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.80,0:27:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别妄动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sudden moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.73,0:28:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住 稳住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.14,0:28:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔...!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless...!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.99,0:29:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 你把我的龙扔在那里了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! You left my dragon back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.16,0:29:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他自己飞不起来! 他会淹死的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't fly on his own! He'll drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.65,0:29:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 呃...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.99,0:29:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得回去找我的龙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to head back for my dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.10,0:30:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.41,0:30:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,窃龙贼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dragon thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,呃... 德雷格·布拉维斯特?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... Drago Bludvist?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.38,0:30:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你听得懂我在说什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.89,0:31:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔! 哦 别担心 没事了 没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless! Oh, it's okay, it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.23,0:31:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很高兴能见到你 我真的好担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad to see you, too, bud. You really had me worried there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.70,0:31:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 呃...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.84,0:31:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.38,0:31:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你是小嗝嗝?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiccup?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.88,0:31:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.38,0:32:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真... 真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C... could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.05,0:32:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年过去了? 这怎么可能?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all these years? How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.89,0:32:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那个... 我们认识吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, should I... Should I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.86,0:32:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你不认识我 你那时还是个婴儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You were only a babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但是妈妈永远忘不掉自己的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a mother never forgets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.38,0:32:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 嘘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.88,0:32:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.05,0:32:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,脾气太倔了! 和他妈妈一样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boar-headed! Just like his mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.51,0:32:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 她也是个闲不住的人 - 他毕竟才二十岁 还是维京人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aye, she could never stay put, either. - Eh, he's just 20, and a Viking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.40,0:32:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还有更差的组合吗? 哈哈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, could there be a worse combination? Heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.05,0:32:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,何况你年轻的时候还不是一样的固执又不懂事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I think of how stubborn and senseless you were back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.76,0:32:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 现在也没好多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Well, not much has changed, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.80,0:33:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道他的 他绝不会放弃 高博{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, you know what he's like. He won't give up, Gobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.81,0:33:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果小嗝嗝在我们之前找到了德雷格...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if Hiccup finds Drago before we find him...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.95,0:33:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的! 只要小嗝嗝身边有那只夜煞 没人伤得了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Nothing can hurt Hiccup, as long as that Night Fury's around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.92,0:33:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是夜煞啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Night Fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.75,0:33:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.54,0:33:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我找到他们 碎颅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find them, Skullcrusher.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.14,0:33:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去找他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.95,0:33:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃 等... 等下 - 来这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh, h... hold on. Wait just a minute. - This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.33,0:33:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回来 - 过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come back here. - Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.64,0:33:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能说出那么惊人的话就跑开吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't just say something like that and run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.22,0:33:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我妈妈?! 这到底...?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my mother?! I mean, what the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.29,0:33:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你... 你知道这听起来有多疯狂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you... do you grasp how insane it sounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.63,0:33:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点过来 - 我有问题要问你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come quickly. - I have questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.92,0:34:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你这些年... 都在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you... been all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.77,0:34:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你... 你都做些什么? 他们... 他们都说你已经死了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What... what have you been doing? But they... they said you were dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.74,0:34:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都觉得你被龙吃了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone thinks you were eaten by...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.85,0:34:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是在这里生活了二十年?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where you've been for 20 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.79,0:34:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你... 你一直在拯救他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You... you've been rescuing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.56,0:35:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真不敢相信 - 你不生气吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unbelievable. - You're not upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.08,0:35:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 我... 我也不知道 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No. I... I don't know. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.37,0:35:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我还没太反应过来呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bit much to get my head around, to be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟 也不是每天你都会发现 你老妈其实是个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not every day you find out your mother is some kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.91,0:35:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,有点吓人的龙族守护者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}crazy, feral, vigilante dragon lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.88,0:35:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.48,0:35:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这样来说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.08,0:35:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我不是个无聊的人 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least I'm not boring, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.35,0:35:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I suppose there is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.12,0:35:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 倒是没错 - 你... 你喜欢这样吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- one specific thing. - Do... do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.69,0:35:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 我不知道该怎么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I don't have the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.60,0:35:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 我能摸摸它吗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C... can I...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.81,0:35:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 他真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he's beautiful. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.64,0:35:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,萌得难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.88,0:35:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能是这个种群的最后一只龙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He might very well be the last of his kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.28,0:36:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哦... 看啊 他和你一样大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh... and look, he's your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.09,0:36:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.49,0:36:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,难怪你们这么合得来 什么? 真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder you get along so well. Oh, yeah? Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.76,0:36:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他的牙可以收回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And retractable teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.21,0:36:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么能... - 我是在树林里找到的它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did you manage... - I found him in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.73,0:36:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他当时受伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was shot down and wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.94,0:36:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,暴牙被德雷格·布拉维斯特的铁制陷阱夹断了一条腿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Snafflefang lost his leg to one of Drago Bludvist's iron traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.98,0:36:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,削雨的翅膀被剃刀网划伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Raincutter had her wing sliced by razor netting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.62,0:36:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这只可怜的拐哼哼被树枝陷阱弄瞎了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this, oh, poor Hobblegrunt was blinded by a tree snare...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.89,0:36:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在孤单和恐惧中等死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then left to die alone and scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.92,0:36:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个呢? 也是被德雷格和他的陷阱害的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what of this? Did Drago or his trappers do this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.00,0:36:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说到这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.03,0:36:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,也算是挺巧的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, crazy thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.77,0:36:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是我把他打伤的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm actually the one who shot him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.21,0:36:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 不过... 现在没事了 他也报复我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's... it's okay, though. He got me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.54,0:37:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对 伙计? 你偏偏不肯快点救我 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, bud? You couldn't save all of me, could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.91,0:37:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,非要跟我算账 所以我的腿才断了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just had to make it even. So peg leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.26,0:37:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你老爸对你的夜煞小伙伴什么态度?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did your father think of your Night Fury friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.76,0:37:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 他... 他一开始不太接受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he... he didn't take it all that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.50,0:37:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不过后来 他就变了 他们都变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then, he changed. They all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.60,0:37:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很快 家乡的每个人都有一只属于自己的龙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty soon, everyone back home had dragons of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.44,0:37:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要是真的就好了 - 就是真的啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If only it were possible. - No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.74,0:37:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我也试过 但是人们很难改变的 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, I tried, as well, but people are not capable of change, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.35,0:37:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.18,0:37:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,生来就注定与众不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were just born different.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.72,0:37:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候 博克岛面临生死存亡的抉择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Berk was a land of kill or be killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.23,0:37:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但我相信和平的希望尚存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I believed peace was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.07,0:37:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,住手! 你这样只能让事情越来越糟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! You'll only make it worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.87,0:37:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,当时没人愿意听我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a very unpopular opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.61,0:38:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.11,0:38:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,后来有一天晚上 一条龙闯进我们家里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then one night, a dragon broke into our house,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.60,0:38:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了摇篮中的你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}finding you in the cradle.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.27,0:38:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我冲过去想要保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I rushed to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.92,0:38:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我看到的一切 证明我的想法是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what I saw was proof of everything I believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.24,0:38:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,它不是什么邪恶的野兽 而是聪明温和的生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This wasn't a vicious beast, but an intelligent, gentle creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.48,0:38:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的灵魂可以产生共鸣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose soul reflected my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.52,0:38:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 沃尔卡 快跑! - 不 别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Valka, run! - No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.79,0:38:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.29,0:38:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,等等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.56,0:39:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不! 斯多戈! - 沃尔卡!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! Stoick! - Valka!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.33,0:39:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,斯多戈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stoick!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.47,0:39:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Valka.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.01,0:39:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上你和你父亲差点丧命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your father nearly died that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.68,0:39:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为我不愿意死杀死一条龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All because I couldn't kill a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.58,0:39:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 这好像是基因决定的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eh, runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.08,0:39:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,和你们分开 我也难过 但是我觉得这样你们才安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It broke my heart to stay away, but I believed you'd be safer if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.22,0:39:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么活下来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.74,0:39:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 跃云并没想伤害我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Cloudjumper never meant to harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.83,0:39:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定是觉得我本来就属于这里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have thought I belonged here...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.67,0:39:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这个美丽的野兽之家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the home of the great Bewilderbeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.14,0:39:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔法一族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Alpha species.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.46,0:39:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,已经濒临灭绝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the very few that still exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.25,0:39:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,每个龙巢都有龙后 但这是万龙之王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every nest has its queen, but this is the king of all dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.82,0:39:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他能喷出冰 建造了我们这个美丽的家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With his icy breath, this graceful giant built our nest,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.52,0:40:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,成为所有龙的栖身之所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a safe haven for dragons everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.26,0:40:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 它就是会喷冰的龙? 那个堡垒就是他毁掉的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, that's the ice-spitter? He's responsible for all that destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.10,0:40:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他在保护我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He protects us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.57,0:40:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们受他庇护 并听命于他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all live under his care and his command.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.07,0:40:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 除了那些龙宝宝...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All but the babies, of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.08,0:40:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们谁的话都不听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who listen to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.66,0:40:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝 我和他们生活了二十年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lived among them for 20 years, Hiccup,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.35,0:40:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,探索他们的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}discovering their secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.80,0:40:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他喜欢你 - 哇哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He likes you. - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.57,0:40:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定饿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.91,0:40:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃 有点饿了 - 太好了 是时候吃饭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh, yeah, I could eat. - Good. It's feeding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.65,0:41:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我不开心 他们现在应该已经带着小嗝嗝回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like it. They should've been back with Hiccup by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.16,0:41:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不开心 艾瑞特 和父亲同名的艾瑞特是我的梦中情人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like it, either. Eret, Son of Eret, was the man of my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.09,0:41:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我的一切!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.40,0:41:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可是 宝贝 我都为你留胡子了 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But, baby, I grew facial hair for you. - Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.50,0:41:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要是德雷格抓住他们了怎么办? 要是他们需要帮助怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if Drago shot them down? What if they need our help?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.31,0:41:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得去找他们 - 等下 你说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to find them. - Wait, wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.81,0:41:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行 斯多戈说... - 要是他们都被抓了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, but Stoick said... - It doesn't matter what he said
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.21,0:41:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他说过什么就不重要了 走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if they've all been captured. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.48,0:41:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还回去吗? - 我们无处可去...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do we go back? - We've nowhere to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.31,0:41:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,空手而归 等着我们的好下场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing to sell, and no heads to call our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.82,0:41:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,假如我们不快点追上那些龙...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't turn up with dragons and fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.96,0:41:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当心自己许的愿望哦! - 帮帮我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Careful what you wish for! - Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.39,0:41:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾瑞特 - 我们会想你的 艾瑞特!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eret, Son of Eret! - We'll miss you, Eret!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.73,0:41:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这是干嘛? - 绑架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is this? - A kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.90,0:41:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,耶 他可以和我一起吗? 可以吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yay, can he ride with me? Can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.44,0:41:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗...?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.11,0:41:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你带路 带我们去找德雷格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna show us the way to Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.11,0:41:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,然后让龙骑士溜进德雷格的营地? 还不如杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And help Dragon Riders sneak into Drago's camp? Just kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.35,0:42:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可以呀 暴飞飞 扔掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could be arranged. Stormfly, drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.12,0:42:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.38,0:42:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好孩子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.15,0:42:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,暴飞飞 捡回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stormfly, fetch.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.09,0:42:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧! 我带你们去找德雷格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Okay! I'll take you to Drago!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.56,0:42:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,屡试不爽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Works every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.97,0:42:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我... 我以为我们要去吃东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I... I thought we were going to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.48,0:42:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.04,0:43:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 从龙之岛 我找到了这群岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, from Dragon Island, I found this archipelago...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.25,0:43:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.62,0:43:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.34,0:44:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在天上飞的时候 我甚至都不觉得寒冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, when I'm up here, I don't even feel the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.18,0:44:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只觉得... - 自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just feel... - Free.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.62,0:44:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是当一条龙的感受 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what it is to be a dragon, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.85,0:44:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,说自己是龙没问题 但是你会飞吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all well and good to call yourself a dragon, but can you fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.68,0:44:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.96,0:45:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 差一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, almost!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.43,0:45:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们差一点就成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just about had it that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.23,0:45:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.34,0:45:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not bad yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.45,0:45:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,过去这么久了 你还是这么像我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this time, you took after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.32,0:45:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可是... 我又在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And... where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.32,0:45:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 小嗝嗝 我们重新来过吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, Hiccup. Can we start over?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.83,0:45:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意再给妈妈一次机会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you give me another chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.57,0:45:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 我可以把我这二十年来学到的都教给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I can teach you all that I've learned these past 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.01,0:45:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,比如...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.08,0:45:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.25,0:45:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你可以控制他们的急转弯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you can make those tight turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.42,0:46:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.20,0:46:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,每条龙都有它的秘密...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every dragon has its secrets. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.53,0:46:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把它们都告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show them all to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.06,0:46:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能解开所有秘密 找到每个珍稀物种... 我们一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll unlock every mystery, find every last species... together,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.55,0:46:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈和儿子一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as mother and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.74,0:46:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都有这种天赋 小嗝嗝 这让我们母子连心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This gift we share, Hiccup, it bonds us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.78,0:46:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是你 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is who you are, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.21,0:46:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是真正的我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.95,0:46:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,为所有的龙 我们会改变这个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will change the world for all dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.69,0:46:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,让这个世界更美好 更安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will make it a better, safer place.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.69,0:46:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 听起来真不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I mean, that sounds amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.84,0:47:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 太好了! 现在我们可以一起去和德雷格谈判了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is so great! Now you and I can go talk to Drago together.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.78,0:47:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 没有什么谈判{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? There's no talking to Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.38,0:47:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是我们得... - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But we have to... - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.99,0:47:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要保护好我们自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must protect our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.55,0:47:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们该回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We should be getting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.89,0:47:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.90,0:47:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好了! 我把你们带来了 放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! I got you here. Now get this thing off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.31,0:47:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别和龙抢玩具 你什么道理都不懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never take a toy from a dragon. Don't you know anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.18,0:47:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么总是我倒霉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does this keep happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.80,0:47:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那下面是什么东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.23,0:47:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,巨大的气泡 说明有巨大的肺 冷水深海生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Large diameter bubbles, massive lungs, cold water deep dweller,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.01,0:48:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这是五级的海怪 或者是六级{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking class five leviathan, maybe six.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.99,0:48:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.89,0:48:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肉丸儿 怎么了 孩子? - 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Meatlug, what's wrong, girl? - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.73,0:48:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别动! - 啊...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't move! - Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.81,0:48:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,德雷格!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drago!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.28,0:48:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.49,0:48:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,总是很高兴见到你 朋友 还在热身呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always great to see you, my friend. Keeping warm up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.86,0:48:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了 我准时带着一批龙来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, as you can see, I am right on time with a new batch of dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.83,0:49:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我兑现承诺了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.23,0:49:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它醒了! - 把绳子扔掉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's waking up! - Drop the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.13,0:49:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来人帮帮忙! - 小心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me some backup here! - Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.00,0:49:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,放下绳子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.10,0:49:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钩牙！ - 你在干什么?!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hookfang! - What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.81,0:49:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在属于我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You belong to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.75,0:49:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,额外惊喜 我也把它们的骑士给你抓来了 不要回报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as an added bonus, I also caught you their riders. No extra charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.24,0:49:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? 你在开玩笑? - 啊! 但是你那么完美!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? Are you kidding me? - Aw! But you were so perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.86,0:50:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,结果那里还有很多龙和骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out there's a whole bunch of them out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.69,0:50:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们攻击了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They attacked...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.63,0:50:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有多少? - 还好德雷格没有抓住他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many? - Drago doesn't have them after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.10,0:50:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多少? - 上百个 整个岛都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many? - Hundreds. A whole island full.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.74,0:50:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我不担心那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.57,0:50:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说话的功夫 我的人就在追杀他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My men are hunting them down as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.84,0:50:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会知道你躲在哪里 我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't know where you're hiding. I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.78,0:50:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会的! 他们知道我们不见了 而且他们有警龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, they will! They know we're missing, and they have tracking dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.32,0:50:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你们敢动我们分毫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you so much as touch us,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.64,0:50:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小嗝嗝就会把你... - 小嗝嗝?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hiccup is gonna kick... - Hiccup?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.65,0:50:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他不成问题 真的 相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a problem. Really, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.85,0:50:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他是伟大的斯多戈的独子 博克岛首领的继承人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's only the son of Stoick The Vast, his heir to the throne of Berk,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.26,0:50:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上迄今为止最伟大的驯龙师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the greatest Dragon Master this world has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.76,0:50:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"驯龙师"? 只有我才能控制龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dragon Master"? I alone control the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.47,0:50:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯...不是 - 不好意思啦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nope, mm-mm. - Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.87,0:50:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你们现在就放我们走 不然他会带着他的夜煞赶到这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And unless you let us go right now, he will blast through here on his Night Fury
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.44,0:50:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,把你们整个船队打个片甲不留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and blow your entire fleet of ships to splinters.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.01,0:50:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会哭的和孩子一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they'll be crying like babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.73,0:50:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 又棒又有意思 - 不错 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Funny and beautiful. - Good one, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.77,0:51:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,像小孩一样 一直哭 不能再小的小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like babies, they always cry. Real tiny ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.09,0:51:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始只有一个骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First there was one rider,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.42,0:51:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,现在整个博克岛都是了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now all of Berk?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.99,0:51:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你还把他们带我这来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you led them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.14,0:51:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 德雷格...! - 停止所有备战!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drago...! - Stop all preparations!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.97,0:51:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须现在就去攻打龙骑士们的老巢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must attack the Dragon Riders' nest at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.21,0:51:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们的阿尔法打败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will take down their Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.78,0:51:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,然后占领博克岛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we will take Berk!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.11,0:51:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 德雷格! - 干掉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drago! - And get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.22,0:51:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 德雷格 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drago, please, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.93,0:51:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,暴飞飞!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stormfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.60,0:51:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.78,0:52:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄...我们不能坐以待毙等着德雷格来攻打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, bud... We can't wait around for Drago to attack this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.80,0:52:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得先找到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to find him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.13,0:52:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.00,0:52:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,淡定 淡定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.50,0:52:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑? 你怎么进来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me? How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.77,0:52:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么带你出去 我们就怎么进来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same way we're getting you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.33,0:52:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- "我们?" - 安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "We"? - All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.74,0:52:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没牙仔 跟上 - 额 等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Toothless, come. - Uh, wait, uh, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.70,0:52:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 额 老爸 还有... 还有些事情你不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, uh, Dad, there... there's something you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.39,0:52:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的 路上说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, tell me on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.74,0:52:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这事可不适合"在路上"说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this isn't an "on the way" kind of update, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.54,0:52:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这话我听够了 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard enough, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.65,0:52:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,惊天动地的变化越来越多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More of the earth-shattering development variety.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.68,0:52:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 等等再说  - 好的 我 额... 嗯...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, just add it to pile. - Yeah, I, uh... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.22,0:52:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 不像给你的大多数惊喜 我保证你会喜欢这个的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, unlike most surprises I spring on you, this is one you'll like, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.39,0:52:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你先控制好情绪 然后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just have to handle it delicately. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.99,0:52:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.36,0:52:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可能得要你来搞定这事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might want to take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.83,0:52:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.73,0:52:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.34,0:53:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 呃 老爸 你先把剑放一边去好不好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, uh, Dad, could you put the sword away, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.59,0:53:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你要说什么 斯多戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're gonna say, Stoick.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.26,0:53:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么可以这样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I have done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.59,0:53:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在外这么多年 为什么我不回你身边?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stayed away all of these years, and why didn't I come back to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.70,0:53:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,回儿子身边?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To our son?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.80,0:53:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可是... 你有改变的迹象吗 斯多戈?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... what sign did I have that you could change, Stoick?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.51,0:53:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还是博克岛的人有改变的迹象?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That anyone on Berk could?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.27,0:53:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我恳求停战那么多次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pleaded so many times to stop the fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.75,0:53:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,找其他解决方式 你们有谁听了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to find another answer, but did any of you listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.71,0:53:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我不结婚的原因 这个和另外一个原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is why I never married. This, and one other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.95,0:53:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我撇下你一人抚养小嗝嗝不容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that I left you to raise Hiccup alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.59,0:53:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我觉得没有我他生活得更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I thought he'd be better off without me,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.83,0:53:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我错了 我知道了 但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I was wrong. I see that now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.40,0:54:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哦! 别再忍着了 斯多戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Stop being so stoic, Stoick.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.47,0:54:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 吼我 骂我 说句话啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, shout, scream, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.94,0:54:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是美如昨日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're as beautiful as the day I lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.88,0:54:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还能更惨吗? - 嗯 让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could this day get any worse? - Uh, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.42,0:54:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要跳到冰冷的海水里淹死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna jump into freezing cold water and then die from drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.25,0:54:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来还不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.25,0:54:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,女士优先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.16,0:54:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是一坨...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a steaming...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.75,0:55:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 热气腾腾的龙... - 低头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- heap of dragon... - Duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.13,0:55:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 通知大家! - 干掉他们 艾瑞特的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Warn the others! - Get them, you son of an Eret.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.07,0:55:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝这个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.84,0:55:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我又爱你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I love you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.58,0:55:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 真可怜 你还是继续跳下去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, pathetic. You can still jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.85,0:55:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我们还把龙救出来然后逃出去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, are we going to save your dragons and get out of here or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.77,0:55:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.95,0:55:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,检查每个笼子 它们肯定都在船上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check every trap. They're here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.46,0:55:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,肉丸儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meatlug?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.70,0:55:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有人想进去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.84,0:55:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 你继续就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, you just keep doing what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.21,0:55:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,继续转呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep cranking.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.02,0:56:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢你救了我一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.33,0:56:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我该还你人情了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let me return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.07,0:56:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 你肯定都认不出这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, you'd never even recognize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.44,0:56:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,本来是造武器的地方 现在我们做龙鞍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where we used to make weapons, we now build saddles,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.74,0:56:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,翼吊带... 我们甚至还给龙补牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wing slings... We even fix dragon teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.84,0:56:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这些变化让你难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't believe how much everything's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.28,0:56:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你儿子让博克岛变得更好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, your son's changed Berk for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.78,0:56:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,咱儿子是我们的杰作 沃尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we did well with this one, Val.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.65,0:56:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.32,0:56:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 有点生疏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm, uh... a little out of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.00,0:56:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我娶你本来就不是看上你的厨艺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know, I didn't marry you for your cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.21,0:56:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿 她做的肉丸的杀伤力比战斧还大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope not. Her meatballs could kill more beasts than a battle ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.78,0:57:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在肚子还在响呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've still got a few knocking around in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.38,0:57:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的龙只要一搬回来住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once you move back in with all your dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.08,0:57:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,老德雷格就一点机会都没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}old Drago won't even stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.50,0:57:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一切都会好起来  - 等等 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everything will be okay. - Slow down, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.39,0:57:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还有好多事情要适应呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lot to take in.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.27,0:57:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.00,0:57:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我可喜欢这歌了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I love this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.42,0:57:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得我们的歌吗 沃尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember our song, Val?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.69,0:57:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在凶猛大海上徜徉远航 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'll swim and sail on savage seas ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.53,0:57:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 永不畏惧沉没还是受伤 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ With ne'er a fear of drowning ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.50,0:58:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 欢欣鼓舞踏着生活波浪 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And gladly ride the waves of life ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.44,0:58:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 假如你愿意当我的新娘 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ If you will marry me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.05,0:58:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 头顶再无烈烈骄阳 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ No scorching sun ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.72,0:58:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 脚下不踩冰封一方 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Nor freezing cold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.69,0:58:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- ∮ 截住... ∮ - ∮ 截住我散漫的流放 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ∮ Will stop... ∮ - ∮ Will stop me on my journey ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.21,0:58:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.30,0:58:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 你若将心托付于我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ If you will promise me your heart ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.11,0:58:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 并爱... ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And love... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.58,0:58:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 并爱我永久不相忘 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And love me for eternity ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.92,0:58:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我最亲爱的宝贝 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ My dearest one, my darling dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.93,0:59:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 海誓山盟让我惊喜万分 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Your mighty words astound me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.10,0:59:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 但那些誓言不一定要成真 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ But I've no need of mighty deeds ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.37,0:59:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 有你臂弯环绕就是天堂 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ when I feel your arms around me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.74,0:59:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 带给你戒指闪闪耀金光 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ But I would bring you rings of gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.37,0:59:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- ∮ 为你唱诗在心中流淌 ∮ - 哇! 哦 你会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ∮ I'd even sing you poetry ∮ - Whoo! Oh, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.19,0:59:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 让你远离所有悲伤 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And I would keep you from all harm ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.59,0:59:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 只要永远在我身旁 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ if you would stay beside me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.92,0:59:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 何必带那戒指闪耀金光 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I have no use for rings of gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.15,0:59:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不必唱诗在我心中流淌 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I care not for your poetry ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.49,0:59:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 只要抓住你的手牢牢不放 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I only want your hand to hold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.02,0:59:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 只要你在我身旁 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I only want you near me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.06,0:59:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 爱你吻你朝思暮想 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ To love and kiss, to sweetly hold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.39,0:59:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在梦里舞蹈飞翔 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ For the dancing and the dreaming ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.33,0:59:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 穿过悲欢离合 让你笑容留在我心上 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Through all my sorrows and delights I'll keep your laugh inside me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.27,0:59:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在凶猛大海上徜徉远航 永不畏惧沉没还是受伤 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'll swim and sail the savage seas with ne'er a fear of drowning ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.00,0:59:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 欢欣鼓舞踏着生活波浪 只要你愿意当我的新娘 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And gladly ride the waves of life if you will marry me... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.97,0:59:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还能唱...没气儿了 - 高博{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm still going... I'm done. - Gobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.48,0:59:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为这辈子也不能再跳一次这舞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I'd have to die before we'd have that dance again.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.49,0:59:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么消极{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No need for drastic measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.96,0:59:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你 亲爱的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you, my dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.29,1:00:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都愿意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.23,1:00:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意回家吗 沃尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you come home, Val?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.63,1:00:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意再次做我的妻子吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you be my wife once again?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.47,1:00:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以组成一个家庭! 你说呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can be a family! What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.31,1:00:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.05,1:00:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,愿意...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.65,1:00:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒! 我来做饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great! I'll do the cooking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.95,1:00:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好你没听我的 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank Odin you didn't listen to me, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.62,1:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我们永远都见不到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never would've found each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.13,1:00:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 没牙仔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.57,1:00:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,出了什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.09,1:01:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.26,1:01:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔... 沃尔 没事的 没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Val... Val, it's all right, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.86,1:01:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在在一起 你想怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a team now. Now, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.73,1:01:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得救救这些龙 - 是 说得对 来吧 儿子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to save the dragons. - Aye, you got it. Come on, son!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.91,1:01:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,装弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reload!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.54,1:01:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.98,1:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,开火! 开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.42,1:01:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不管来了什么 持续攻打那座山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever comes, keep hitting the Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.69,1:01:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要把阿尔法引出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to draw the Alpha out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.30,1:01:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,准备陷阱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready the traps!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.36,1:02:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,惊喜! 耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.46,1:02:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.83,1:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是让我们惊喜不断啊 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really are full of surprises. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.14,1:02:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,龙骑士登场!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragon Riders coming through!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.71,1:02:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.08,1:02:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.62,1:02:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,截住他们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut them down!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.46,1:02:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,艾瑞特 救我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eret, Son of Eret!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.40,1:03:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,向上 孩子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up, girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.97,1:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,左倾 艾瑞特! 对了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lean left, Eret! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.34,1:03:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,小心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.65,1:03:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,耶! 宝贝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.96,1:03:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们打下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them down!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.93,1:03:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,注意点喽!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.97,1:03:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,驯龙师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragon Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.27,1:03:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎来到战场 龙骑士 - 多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome aboard, Dragon Rider. - Thanks. I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.14,1:03:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去哪里了? - 噢 和我妈妈在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where have you been? - Oh, you know, catching up with Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.29,1:03:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你妈妈?!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your mother?!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.03,1:03:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 现在你知道我从哪遗传的天赋了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now you know where I get my dramatic flair.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.73,1:04:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是阿尔法! 我们终于能打一仗了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Alpha! Now we have a fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.12,1:04:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 没牙仔 给他们看看你的本事 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Toothless. Show them what you got, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.63,1:04:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attaboy!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.61,1:04:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我已经等了太长时间了 - 你不能掳走我们的龙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've waited a long time for this. - You cannot take our dragons!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.31,1:04:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔法才是它们的王!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are controlled by the Alpha!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.45,1:04:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那正好 我把夺位者带来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it's a good thing I brought a challenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.41,1:05:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,又来一个大的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another one?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.01,1:05:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了了! 不得了了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a class ten! Class ten!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不... 不... - 给我上! 把阿尔法打败!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No... no... - Come on! Take down the Alpha!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.60,1:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 亲爱的 为了你 怎样都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - For you, my dear... anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.25,1:06:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 沃尔 你能阻止他们吗? - 我会尽我所能 出发 跃云!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Val, do you think you can stop them? - I'll do my best. Come on, Cloudjumper!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.52,1:06:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.82,1:06:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看着你烧死的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watched you burn!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.99,1:06:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那么点小火还想烧死我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes more than a little fire to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.78,1:06:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,斯多戈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stoick!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.97,1:06:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.64,1:06:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.46,1:07:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赢了 现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've won. Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.40,1:07:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杀了她! - 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Finish her! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.31,1:07:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住! 碎颅 出发!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on! Skullcrusher, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.98,1:07:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟上 高博! - 马上 斯多戈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Gobber! - Right behind you, Stoick!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.70,1:08:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,住手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.77,1:08:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,住手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.28,1:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你... 你就是所谓的驯龙师?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This... is the great Dragon Master?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.32,1:08:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的斯多戈的儿子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The son of Stoick the Vast?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.72,1:08:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他该有多羞愧啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What shame he must feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.76,1:08:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所有这些龙的牺牲... 都是为了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of this loss... and for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.33,1:08:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,为了证明你所向无敌? 为了统治世界?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To become unstoppable? To rule the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.44,1:08:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,龙是善良 神奇的生物 能让人类更加团结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragons, the... they are kind, amazing creatures that can bring people together.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.94,1:08:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也能摧毁人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or tear them apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.75,1:08:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 生活在恐惧中是什么感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, I know what it is to live in fear,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.95,1:08:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看见我的村庄被烧光 我的家庭被拆散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see my village burned, my family taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.83,1:08:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但即使我只是个孩子...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But even as a boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.56,1:08:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当时一无所有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}left with nothing,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.16,1:09:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我仍然发誓要超越对龙的恐惧...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I vowed to rise above the fear of dragons...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.37,1:09:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,解放这个世界上的所有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and liberate the people of this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.34,1:09:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么需要一支龙族战队?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why a dragon army?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.64,1:09:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要龙来要想征服龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you need dragons to conquer other dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.05,1:09:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是你需要龙来征服人类吧...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe you need dragons to conquer people...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.75,1:09:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去控制那些听话的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to control those who follow you...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.95,1:09:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭那些不听话的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to get rid of those who won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.82,1:09:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是聪明的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clever boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.69,1:09:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,世界需要和平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world wants peace,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.33,1:09:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而在博克岛有你要的答案 只需要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we have the answer back on Berk. Just...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.87,1:09:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我带你去看...  - 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- let me show you... - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.67,1:09:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还是让我... 带你看看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me... show you!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.32,1:09:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.82,1:09:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.79,1:10:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上 高博!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Gobber!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.98,1:10:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 计划变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, change of plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.10,1:10:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所有龙都必须服从阿尔法的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No dragon can resist the Alpha's command.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.73,1:10:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说谁能够控制阿尔法...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he who controls the Alpha...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.87,1:10:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谁就能统领所有的龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}controls them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.34,1:10:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.42,1:10:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔 你还好么 兄弟? 怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless, you okay, bud? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.79,1:10:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,见证真正的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Witness true strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.79,1:10:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,控制一切的意志力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The strength of will over others.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.30,1:10:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,面对事实吧 你什么都不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the face of it, you are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.91,1:10:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,呃... 他刚才跟你说什么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... what did he just tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.25,1:10:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔 不要这样 你怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless, come on. What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.75,1:11:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 快清醒 你在干什么? 停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, come on, what are you doing? Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.35,1:11:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,停! 快清醒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.70,1:11:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔 不! 没牙仔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless, no! Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.60,1:11:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要! - 小嗝嗝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't! - Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.57,1:11:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 停! - 儿子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop...! - Son!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.91,1:11:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸! 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.65,1:11:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.96,1:11:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.17,1:11:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.44,1:11:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,斯多戈...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stoick...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.01,1:12:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸? 不 你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad? No. You...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.50,1:12:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.91,1:12:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.76,1:12:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 离他远点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.00,1:12:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快走! 快滚开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.84,1:13:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.86,1:13:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是他的错 你心里明白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not his fault. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.85,1:13:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,如今善良的龙被邪恶的人统治...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good dragons under the control of bad people...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.69,1:13:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,会做出邪恶的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do bad things.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.31,1:13:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,精神点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.78,1:13:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把人都聚集起来 到博克岛与我会合!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gather the men and meet me at Berk!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.11,1:13:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没牙仔! - 不 别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Toothless! - No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.21,1:14:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,愿战神迎接你 带你走出欧丁神的伟大战场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the Valkyries welcome you and lead you through Odin's great battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.08,1:14:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,愿他们带着爱与愤怒唱出你的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May they sing your name with love and fury,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.25,1:14:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们就能从瓦尔哈拉殿堂的深处听见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that we might hear it rise from the depths of Valhalla,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.22,1:14:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能知道你已找到你在众国王中的席位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and know that you've taken your rightful place at the table of kings.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.00,1:14:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一个伟大的人逝世了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a great man has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.07,1:14:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他是一名战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.90,1:14:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是首领 是父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chieftain. A father.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.61,1:14:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是挚友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.74,1:15:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.49,1:15:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是... 你所希望的那样的首领{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the chief that... you wanted me to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.43,1:15:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不是自己想象的那种和平使者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not the peacekeeper I thought I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.10,1:15:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 我不知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... don't know...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.68,1:16:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,生你的时候早产 刚出生时真的太小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came early into this world. You were such a wee thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.92,1:16:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 那么瘦小 那么虚弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, so frail, so fragile.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.52,1:16:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我担心能不能把你养活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feared you wouldn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.89,1:16:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你的父亲...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your father...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.54,1:16:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他从未怀疑过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he never doubted.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.27,1:16:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直说你能成为所有人中最强大的那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He always said you'd become the strongest of them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.34,1:16:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他说得没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.37,1:16:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你拥有一颗首领的心 拥有龙的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the heart of a chief, and the soul of a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.45,1:16:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你能团结整个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only you can bring our worlds together.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.39,1:16:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这... 就是你 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That... is who you are, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.80,1:16:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我 呃...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.17,1:16:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经害怕成为父亲那样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so afraid of becoming my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.18,1:17:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我觉得我永远都做不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mostly because I thought I never could.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.25,1:17:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么... 怎么才能成为一个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How... how do you become someone...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.32,1:17:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那样伟大 那样... 勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that great, that... brave,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.92,1:17:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那样... 无私的人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that... selfless?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.82,1:17:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那就只能好好努力了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you can only try.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.90,1:17:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,首领要保护好族人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chief protects his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.17,1:17:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.18,1:17:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃... 怎么回去? - 呃 他把所有的龙都带走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh... with what? - Uh, he took all the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.18,1:17:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是所有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.29,1:17:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.62,1:17:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇! - 哇 哇 哇 哇 哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa! - Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.29,1:17:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.00,1:17:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这些真的是没法骑啊! - 就是啊 真的没法骑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can't fly these things! - Yeah, no kidding!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.70,1:18:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,难道万兽之王不会也把它们控制住吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But won't that Bewilderbeast just take control of these guys, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.81,1:18:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,它们还是小宝宝! 它们不会听任何人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're babies! They don't listen to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.91,1:18:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 跟我们一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Just like us.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.05,1:18:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是... 哇! 太危险了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is... whoa!... very dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.85,1:18:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有人可能会觉得这真不是什么好计划!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some might suggest this is poorly conceived!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.22,1:18:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我的优点就是从来就不听话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's a good thing that I never listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.26,1:18:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.66,1:18:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那... 你到底...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... what is your...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.40,1:18:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么计划啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.46,1:18:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把没牙仔夺回来 打败德雷格...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Toothless back and kick Drago's...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.63,1:18:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,抬头!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.57,1:18:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.14,1:18:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哇... 喔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa... ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.63,1:18:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真是好孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, that's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.57,1:19:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,小心家具!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch the furniture!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.30,1:19:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.89,1:19:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的首领... 死了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your chief... is dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.13,1:19:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯多戈死了? - 不可能!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stoick? - Not possible!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.40,1:19:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没有人能够保护你们了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can protect you now!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.98,1:19:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.68,1:19:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他收走了所有龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took all the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.49,1:19:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,分散他的注意力 把他从没牙仔那引开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Distract the Alpha. Try to keep his focus off of Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.59,1:20:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 怎么实施?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, how?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.09,1:20:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了你骑着什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you forgotten who you're riding with?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.06,1:20:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上还没有我不能驾驭的龙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There isn't a dragon alive that I can't wrangle!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.10,1:20:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 除了这个...! - 真业余{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Except for this one...! - Amateur.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.37,1:20:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 快看! 是小嗝嗝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look! It's Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.57,1:20:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.88,1:20:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不停地送羊过来! - 来头黑的 宝贝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep 'em coming! - Black sheep, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.40,1:20:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,十分!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten points!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.14,1:20:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.02,1:21:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.30,1:21:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你确实是很难摆脱啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You certainly are hard to get rid of, I'll say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.70,1:21:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.20,1:21:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.70,1:21:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.21,1:21:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是我啊 是我 我就在这儿 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me. It's me. I'm right here, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.98,1:21:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,快回到我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.21,1:21:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他不再属于你了 他只听从阿尔法的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not yours anymore. He belongs to the Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.25,1:21:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 伟大的驯龙师 您请{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, please, o great Dragon Master,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.82,1:21:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,用您最大的劲儿召唤他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}try... to take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.46,1:21:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他可不想错过第二次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will not miss a second time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.79,1:21:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是你的错 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't your fault, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.50,1:21:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们... 强迫你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They... made you do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.38,1:22:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没有伤害过父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd never hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.95,1:22:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你也从来没有伤害过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd never hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.89,1:22:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you doing that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.86,1:22:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 你是我最好的朋友 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. You are my best friend, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.50,1:22:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.84,1:22:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮! 就是这样! 我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attaboy! That's it! I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.08,1:22:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.92,1:22:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeehaw!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.92,1:22:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,等着!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.79,1:22:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快了 兄弟 我马上就到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there, buddy, almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.77,1:22:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快做些什么啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.27,1:23:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要把他们俩分开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get those two apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.98,1:23:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须阻止他 没牙仔 你信任我吗 兄弟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta block him out, Toothless. Do you trust me, bud?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.19,1:23:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.26,1:23:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你... 和我... 我们合二为一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You... and me... as one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.80,1:23:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样 现在我们再试一次!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Now let's try this one more time!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.39,1:23:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,打败他 亲爱的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him down, babe!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.87,1:23:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,把他拿下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.41,1:23:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,控制它!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take control of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.45,1:23:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不要受干扰 没牙仔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it out, Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.62,1:23:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阻止他们! - 就是现在!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop them! - Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.77,1:24:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,又来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not again.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.88,1:24:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔 成败在此一举!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless, it's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.08,1:24:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快来 兄弟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, bud!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.55,1:24:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.36,1:24:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,耶! 我们做到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeehaw! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.30,1:24:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看好他 没牙仔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold him there, Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.84,1:24:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在一切都结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.64,1:24:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,果真如此吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.61,1:24:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.06,1:25:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.44,1:25:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.70,1:25:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiccup...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.87,1:25:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在挑战阿尔法! - 为了保护你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's challenging the Alpha! - To protect you!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.36,1:26:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 不! 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.57,1:26:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,回击! 回击! 回击!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight back! Fight! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.64,1:26:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.92,1:26:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你明白了吗? 赢得了龙的忠心就是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now do you get it? This is what it is to earn a dragon's loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.89,1:26:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let this end now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.03,1:26:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能! 上啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.42,1:27:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,回击!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.55,1:27:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的阿尔法... 保护所有的龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Alpha... protects them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.55,1:28:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是不停带给我惊喜 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never cease to amaze me, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.99,1:28:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.52,1:28:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没牙仔 你知道这洗不掉的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toothless, you know that doesn't wash out!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.06,1:29:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就知道你会回来的! - 你终于回来了 我的宝贝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I knew you'd come back! - You're back, my beauty!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.90,1:29:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,噢! 噢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.23,1:29:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,暴飞飞!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stormfly!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.40,1:29:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 过来抱一抱 小暴龙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, give me a cuddle, Grumpy!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.54,1:29:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,噢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.41,1:29:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我的小公主!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's my little princess!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.31,1:29:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你再也不许离开我了 钩牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you ever leave again, Hookfang.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.81,1:29:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你 就是你 我好想你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you are. Yes, you are. I missed you...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.95,1:29:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 吐吐... 不是你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Barf... Not you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.12,1:29:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚御龙那几招真不是吹的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was some pretty fine dragon-wrangling back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.91,1:29:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你捕龙肯定也是好手 喔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd make a good trapper. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.06,1:29:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你也看到了... 碎颅现在需要有人来照看他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know... Skullcrusher is gonna need somebody to look after him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.07,1:29:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是说我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.20,1:29:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,荣幸之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be honored.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.61,1:29:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲会和我一样骄傲的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father, he'd be every bit as proud as I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.68,1:29:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 很高兴你在我身边 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. I'm really glad you're here, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.35,1:29:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我会留在这里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.95,1:30:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吧? 我告诉过你要相信这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? I told you it was in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.22,1:30:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.23,1:30:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是喜欢玩这一招 真是笑死人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still doing that one. That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.73,1:30:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快过来 - 嗯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come here, you. - Mm!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.23,1:30:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,喔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.70,1:30:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,首领回家了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chief has come home!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.10,1:30:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.74,1:30:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,首领万岁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the chief!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.91,1:30:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,首领万岁! 首领万岁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the chief! Long live the chief!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.18,1:30:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,首领万岁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the chief!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.86,1:31:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yah-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.04,1:31:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这里... 就是博克岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This... is Berk.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.97,1:31:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有些被破坏 损毁 被冰雪覆盖 但这就是家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bit trampled and busted and covered in ice, but it's home.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.31,1:31:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our home.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.95,1:31:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那些袭击我们的人残酷 疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those who attacked us are relentless and crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.92,1:31:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但那些阻止他们的? 噢... 更是疯狂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But those who stopped them? Oh... even more so!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.83,1:31:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也许渺小 但是我们所代表的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may be small in numbers, but we stand for something
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.33,1:31:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,却要比世界上任何敌对力量要强大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bigger than anything the world can pit against us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.74,1:31:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是和平的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the voice of peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.17,1:31:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢地 我们将改变整个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bit by bit, we will change this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.48,1:32:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,喔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.25,1:32:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你看到了 我们有他们没有的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, we have something they don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.02,1:32:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 当然 他们有军队 有舰队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sure, they have armies, and they have armadas,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.63,1:32:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们... 我们有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we... we have...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.59,1:32:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的龙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our dragons!
